abstract: >-
  A reproducible, fully open-source testbed for 5G NR Non-Terrestrial
  Networks demonstrating a complete end-to-end 3GPP Release-17
  geostationary (GEO) satellite attach using OpenAirInterface (OAI)
  and Open5GS, with the satellite channel emulated in OAI's RF
  simulator. The testbed completes cell synchronisation, SIB19
  acquisition, four-step random access, RRC setup, NAS registration,
  and PDU session establishment over an emulated 238.74 ms one-way
  GEO link. Includes a protocol-level fix making the gNB random-access
  response window NTN-aware, and a reference architecture document.
